{%- comment -%}
  GPSR Article 19 — product safety information in the online offer.

  Regulation (EU) 2023/988 requires that an online offer of a product carries,
  in the offer itself, the manufacturer's name and postal and electronic
  address; where the manufacturer is outside the EU, the details of the EU
  responsible person; product identification including type, batch or serial
  number; and any warnings or safety information, in a language the consumer
  easily understands.

  Two implementation notes that matter:

  1. Footer or terms-page placement does not satisfy this. The information must
     be on, or one click from, the product page. That is why this snippet
     renders inline on the PDP rather than in the footer.

  2. The local-language requirement means Dutch for NL, German for DE. These
     fields are therefore translatable metafields, not theme settings — the
     content differs per product AND per market.

  Source: research/eu-compliance-constraints.md §2.3. That research rests on
  secondary summaries; the primary text could not be opened from the build
  environment. REQUIRES PROFESSIONAL VERIFICATION before launch.

  Accepts: product
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign m = product.metafields.compliance
  assign has_manufacturer = false
  if m.manufacturer_name != blank
    assign has_manufacturer = true
  endif
-%}

{%- if has_manufacturer -%}
  <section class="regulatory" aria-labelledby="regulatory-heading-{{ product.id }}">
    <h2 id="regulatory-heading-{{ product.id }}" class="text-s">
      {{ 'product.regulatory.heading' | t }}
    </h2>

    <dl>
      <dt>{{ 'product.regulatory.manufacturer' | t }}</dt>
      <dd>
        {{ m.manufacturer_name | escape }}<br>
        {{ m.manufacturer_address | escape | newline_to_br }}<br>
        {%- if m.manufacturer_email != blank -%}
          <a href="mailto:{{ m.manufacturer_email }}">{{ m.manufacturer_email }}</a>
        {%- endif -%}
      </dd>

      {%- comment -%}
        Only rendered when the manufacturer is outside the EU. For this venture
        the merchant is the NL-established responsible person in most cases, so
        this block will usually be empty — but the theme must support the other
        case or it cannot list a third-party product lawfully.
      {%- endcomment -%}
      {%- if m.responsible_person_name != blank -%}
        <dt>{{ 'product.regulatory.responsible_person' | t }}</dt>
        <dd>
          {{ m.responsible_person_name | escape }}<br>
          {{ m.responsible_person_address | escape | newline_to_br }}<br>
          {%- if m.responsible_person_email != blank -%}
            <a href="mailto:{{ m.responsible_person_email }}">{{ m.responsible_person_email }}</a>
          {%- endif -%}
        </dd>
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- if m.product_identifier != blank -%}
        <dt>{{ 'product.regulatory.identification' | t }}</dt>
        <dd>{{ m.product_identifier | escape }}</dd>
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- if m.country_of_origin != blank -%}
        <dt>{{ 'product.regulatory.origin' | t }}</dt>
        <dd>{{ m.country_of_origin | escape }}</dd>
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- if m.materials != blank -%}
        <dt>{{ 'product.regulatory.materials' | t }}</dt>
        <dd>{{ m.materials | escape }}</dd>
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- if m.care_instructions != blank -%}
        <dt>{{ 'product.regulatory.care' | t }}</dt>
        <dd>{{ m.care_instructions | escape }}</dd>
      {%- endif -%}
    </dl>

    {%- if m.warnings != blank -%}
      <div role="note">
        <strong>{{ 'product.regulatory.warnings' | t }}</strong>
        <div>{{ m.warnings }}</div>
      </div>
    {%- endif -%}
  </section>
{%- else -%}
  {%- comment -%}
    Deliberately loud. A product without compliance data must not be quietly
    published: under GPSR it cannot lawfully be offered, and a silent empty
    block is exactly how that gets missed. Visible only to staff.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- if request.design_mode or content_for_header contains 'preview_bar_injector' -%}
    <section class="regulatory" style="border-color: #c00; color: #c00;">
      <strong>Missing GPSR data for “{{ product.title }}”.</strong>
      This product cannot lawfully be offered in the EU until
      <code>compliance.manufacturer_name</code>, <code>manufacturer_address</code>
      and <code>manufacturer_email</code> metafields are populated.
      See <code>venture/operations/gpsr-runbook.md</code>.
    </section>
  {%- endif -%}
{%- endif -%}
